03:12.560 --> 03:14.880
It's my fault.

03:15.480 --> 03:16.800
I'm sorry.

03:17.880 --> 03:19.320
My apologies.

03:19.760 --> 03:23.800
Leave the renovation to the Imperial Astronomy Bureau.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.920
