04:04.040 --> 04:06.480
I second it.

04:06.480 --> 04:08.360
I second it.

04:08.360 --> 04:10.120
Please think twice, Your Majesty.

04:10.800 --> 04:13.280
Please think twice, Your Majesty.

04:15.480 --> 04:20.279
Please think twice, Your Majesty.

04:21.480 --> 04:22.960
Those bastards.

04:23.200 --> 04:25.680
I clearly informed them two days ago.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.480
