04:32.960 --> 04:34.080
Something is wrong.

04:34.080 --> 04:35.640
Please think twice, Your Majesty.

04:36.320 --> 04:40.320
Please think twice, Your Majesty.

04:41.080 --> 04:42.360
He Lian Jin.

04:42.920 --> 04:44.960
How long do you think you can be arrogant?

04:48.040 --> 04:48.840
Court adjourned.

05:03.360 --> 05:04.200
Go.

05:04.200 --> 05:05.440
