08:06.040 --> 08:08.040
Loyalty and gentleman.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.880
Who knows if he's ambitious or low?

08:12.120 --> 08:12.920
What?

08:17.440 --> 08:18.440
Well,

08:19.000 --> 08:20.320
