08:59.680 --> 09:00.600
Pass my order.

09:00.960 --> 09:02.880
Seal the Empress Dowager's chamber.

09:02.880 --> 09:04.200
As a woman,

09:04.200 --> 09:06.080
I believe I can punish you.

09:06.840 --> 09:07.560
Yes.

09:07.560 --> 09:08.480
I'm on it.

09:15.640 --> 09:17.400
A letter from Yanhua Palace

09:17.720 --> 09:20.000
Even the people of the Heavenly Camp

09:20.000 --> 09:21.840
can't save her for a while.

09:22.200 --> 09:24.480
The Heavenly Force doesn't only acknowledge the Shen family.

09:26.760 --> 09:29.200
When you become my woman,

09:29.240 --> 09:30.840
and give birth to my child,

09:31.120 --> 09:33.160
Everything of the Shen family

09:33.160 --> 09:35.160
