09:47.080 --> 09:49.240
General He Lian is here early.

09:52.360 --> 09:53.360
Not early.

09:53.800 --> 09:56.600
I'm here to report the latest secret report to Her Highness.

09:56.960 --> 09:58.000
I sneaked into the palace.

09:58.680 --> 09:59.800
I just came here.

10:00.160 --> 10:01.120
Just like

10:06.160 --> 10:07.720
Look at your eyes.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.120
