10:40.720 --> 10:41.520
Lord Huo.

10:42.160 --> 10:43.560
Change the dynasty.

10:43.840 --> 10:45.640
you will be promoted by the law.

10:46.000 --> 10:48.960
I will arrange for you to take the exam.

10:49.840 --> 10:51.360
The gentry are poor.

10:51.360 --> 10:53.440
